:txc}#modulex-treatment .tx-section ol li{counter-increment:txc;padding-left:34px}#modulex-treatment .tx-section ol li::before{content:counter(txc);position:absolute;left:0;top:6px;width:22px;height:22px;background:#0F766E;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center;line-height:22px}#modulex-treatment .tx-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:8px}#modulex-treatment .tx-card{padding:18px;background:#FAFAF9;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #E7E5E4}#modulex-treatment .tx-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#0F766E}#modulex-treatment .tx-card p{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.55;color:#57534E}#modulex-treatment .tx-card ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}#modulex-treatment .tx-card ul li{padding:4px 0 4px 18px;font-size:0.82rem;color:#78716C;border:none}#modulex-treatment .tx-card ul li::before{width:5px;height:5px;top:10px;background:#14B8A6}#modulex-treatment .tx-contact{margin-top:8px;padding:22px 26px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0F766E 0%,#0D9488 100%);border-radius:12px;color:#fff}#modulex-treatment .tx-contact h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1rem;color:#fff;border:none;padding:0}#modulex-treatment .tx-contact p{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;color:#F0FDFA}#modulex-treatment .tx-contact p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}#modulex-treatment .tx-contact strong{color:#fff}#modulex-treatment .tx-note{margin-top:4px;padding:12px 16px;background:#F5F0E8;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.82rem;color:#78716C;font-style:italic}</style><div id=\"modulex-treatment\"><div class=\"tx-hero\"><h2>Real Productions from Our Workshop</h2><p class=\"tx-lead\">From letters to signs, from printing to vehicle wrapping: the product families produced in our Gaziantep workshop, gathered on one page. The details, materials and photos of each product are on its service page.</p></div><div class=\"tx-body\"><div class=\"tx-section\"><h3>Production Families</h3><p>Our workshop produces the following families. Each product has its own service page with details, materials and visuals:</p><ul><li><a href=\"/tr/kutu-harf-oja/\">Box letters and raised letters</a> — letter cutting, body assembly, LED installation</li><li><a href=\"/tr/led-tabela-0j5/\">LED signs</a> and <a href=\"/tr/isikli-tabela-sg7/\">illuminated signs</a></li><li><a href=\"/tr/totem-tabela-3ph/\">Totem signs</a></li><li><a href=\"/tr/dijital-baski-9a6/\">Digital printing</a>, <a href=\"/tr/vinil-baski/\">vinyl printing</a>, <a href=\"/tr/uv-baski-eh2/\">UV printing</a></li><li><a href=\"/tr/tam-arac-kaplama/\">Full vehicle wrapping</a></li><li><a href=\"/tr/stand-sistemleri/\">Stand and fair systems</a>, <a href=\"/tr/promosyon-urunleri-ijc/\">promotional products</a></li><li><a href=\"/tr/logo-tasarimi-q7z/\">Logo design</a> and <a href=\"/tr/kurumsal-kimlik-wkl/\">corporate identity</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"tx-section\"><h3>Production Steps</h3><p>Every production follows the same steps: site survey and measurement, design and 3D mockup approval, production and quality control, installation and handover. Step details are on the <a href=\"/tr/uretim-sureci/\">Sign Production Process</a> page.</p></div><div class=\"tx-section\"><h3>Quality Control</h3><p>When production is complete, lighting and connection tests are performed. A final check is applied before installation; after installation the project is handed over with a lighting test. After handover, maintenance, repair and revision requests are also evaluated.</p></div><div class=\"tx-section\"><h3>Production in One Hand</h3><p>Because design, production and installation are carried out by a single team, the project is followed from start to finish by one hand. See our <a href=\"/tr/hakkimizda/\">About Us</a> page for our approach.</p></div><div class=\"tx-section\"><h3>Get a Quote</h3><p>For a written quote, area, material, measurement and delivery information is enough. The survey flow is on the <a href=\"/tr/tabela-kesif/\">Sign Survey and Quote</a> page.</p><p><a href=\"https://wa.me/905316791014?text=Merhaba%2C%20ger%C3%A7ek%20%C3%BCretimlerimiz%20hakk%C4%B1nda%20bilgi%20almak%20istiyorum.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Write on WhatsApp</a></p></div><div class=\"tx-section\"><h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3><details><summary>Which products are produced in the workshop?</summary>Box and raised letters, LED and illuminated signs, totems, digital, vinyl and UV printing, vehicle wrapping, stands and promotional products are produced in our workshop. Each product has its own service page.</details><details><summary>Does production start without design approval?</summary>No. A design proposal and 3D mockup are shared; production starts after your approval.</details><details><summary>Is there a check before handover?</summary>Yes. Lighting and connection tests are performed after production, a lighting test after installation, and then the project is handed over.</details></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https://reklamatolyesi.org/en/gercek-uretimler/#article\",\"headline\":\"Real Productions from Our Workshop\",\"description\":\"Box letters, LED signs, totems, printing, vehicle wrapping, stands and promotional products produced in our Gaziantep workshop: production steps, quality control and installation — Reklam Atölyesi.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"url\":\"https://reklamatolyesi.org/en/gercek-uretimler/\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-28\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-28\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://reklamatolyesi.org/#organization\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://reklamatolyesi.org/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://reklamatolyesi.org/en/gercek-uretimler/#webpage\"}}</script>",
